 "credit": "Models by jelaludo (the owner's own; https://jelaludo.github.io/SentryTowers_A6/): the Dome Colony modules the Dome City is composed of (six dome roles and the 52 m long bridge; the city's placement is assets/dome-city/layout.json upstream, read into src/content/dome-city.js), the YushiRover biomass recovery rover, the SAI-92 mining hopper and its service bay, and the Yushi045 Bio-Pearl binder container, at `revision` (2026-11-05). D0 only (the author lists D1-D3 as pending), game tier LOD1 and static distance tier LOD2, plain GLB (the build meshopt-packs them). `clips: []` pins a model with no baked clips (the rover, the hopper and the pearl are engine-driven through named nodes; their runtime.js adapters are kept as the reference, dependency-injected with the game's Three). The Yushi045's fill level is a custom `_YUSHI` vertex attribute: the build must keep it (gltfpack -kv) or the capacity shader throws. Hashes are the author's manifests'; scripts/assets.mjs verifies them on fetch.",
